# Hot Cross Buns: the whole tune on string 3 (repertoire plan: hot-cross-buns).
# Hand in second position: finger 1 on fret 2 (A), finger 3 on fret 4 (B), so nothing stretches.
# The teacher track strums G, with D under the A notes in bar 3.
